{"sections":[{"slug":"除幂结构","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"除幂结构"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">除幂结构</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"除幂结构"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">固定环</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">和理想</span> $I$. <span lang=\"zh\">一个除幂结构</span> (divided power structure) <span lang=\"zh\">是一族映射</span> $\\gamma_n\\colon I\\to A\\,(n\\geq 0)$, <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\gamma_0(x)=1$,</li>\n<li>$\\gamma_1(x)=x$,</li>\n<li>$\\gamma_n(x)\\in I\\,(n\\geq 1)$,</li>\n<li>$\\gamma_n(x+y)=\\sum_{i+j=n}\\gamma_i(x)\\gamma_j(y)$,</li>\n<li>$\\gamma_n(\\lambda x)=\\lambda ^n\\gamma_n(x)$,</li>\n<li>$\\gamma_i(x)\\gamma_j(x)=\\binom{i+j}{i}\\gamma_{i+j}(x)$,</li>\n<li>$\\gamma_i(\\gamma_j(x))=\\dfrac{(ij)!}{i!(j!)^i}\\gamma_{ij}(x)$.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n"}}}]}